BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Creedence Clearwater Revival Tribute
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260822
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260823
DTSTAMP:20260822T105517Z
UID:2a81325fd5652bfcf21e41d5b1e9@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Creedence Revived has rapidly become one of the most highly so
 ught after tribute bands in the world. Playing all over the globe for crow
 ds upwards of 30\,000\, and with a track-record of selling out shows every
 where they go\, this group is the real deal. The group is made up of four 
 of Chicago’s &amp\; LA’s most talented and eclectic musicians &#8211\;
  consisting of an award winning vocalist nicknamed “the chameleon” in 
 the industry for his unique ability to shift his vocal to match the style 
 of any vocalist\, a world-renowned blues guitarist who attracts blues fans
  from around the world\, a studio bassist who has a appeared on many top c
 harting albums\, and a drummer who sells out theaters on his own based sol
 ely on his unique playing style. Representing America across the globe\, C
 reedence Revived has toured Europe and Malaysia. Talent buyers and event c
 oordinators often boast about their results and the group frequently gets 
 re-hired year after year to return to the same events with fans walking aw
 ay in awe of the group’s performance.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodei
 sland.com/event/creedence-clearwater-revival-tribute/111161/
LOCATION:Stadium Theatre\, 28 Monument Square\, Woonsocket\, RI 02895
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/creedence-clearwater-revival-tr
 ibute/111161/
END:VEVENT
