DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 16th annual Rhode Island Seafood Festival\, a 
 two-day extravaganza of the Ocean State’s best seafood\, live music and 
 fun for the whole family\, on Sept. 12 and 13\, 2026. Your ticket covers a
 dmission into India Point Park for one or both days of the festival\, depe
 nding on the ticket type you purchased. The ticket price includes a full d
 ay of live music from local bands\, as well as access to our restaurant an
 d art vendors. Food and drink are not included in the ticket price. The Rh
 ode Island Seafood Festival is an annual event which began in 2011 that br
 ings together the best local purveyors of seafood and other fine fare as w
 ell as beer\, wine and spirits from Ocean State producers. Please note: Ch
 ildren 12 years and under are admitted free and do not require a ticket to
  enter.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/rhode-island-sea
 food-festival-2026/111348/
LOCATION:India Point Park\, 201 India Street\, Providence\, RI 02903 Time:
  11:00 AM 201 India Street\, Providence\, RI 02903 OFFICIAL RHODE ISLAND T
